  (text "DESIGN INTENT: the PCB measures, it does not\ncarry generator power. Generator output and\nload stay off-board.\n\nDivider values are TBD because the generator\ntype (DC / rectified AC / 3-phase), open-circuit\nvoltage and load are not established.\n\nAlternative path: an I2C power monitor module\n(e.g. INA219/INA226 breakout) on J12, placed\nin the generator/load loop, measures V and I\ntogether. Bus address/isolation TBD.\n\nElectrical power must be computed from\nsynchronised V and I samples (P = V*I at the\nstated terminals), not from raw ADC counts."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 172.72 40.64 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left top)
    )
    (uuid "dd181a10-4c99-517c-abe1-c8b748892dbe")
  )
  (embedded_fonts no)
